{"uid":"f003440b69251b69","name":"test_resume_with_no_new_flags_reverts_to_job_yamls_own_value","fullName":"tests.test_cli_features#test_resume_with_no_new_flags_reverts_to_job_yamls_own_value","historyId":"4acda2b4e0f84402c755e69f25945f07","time":{"start":1791925297554,"stop":1791925297825,"duration":271},"description":"The #94 (d) decision, proven at the CLI-black-box level: the three\n    new knobs are process-only. This harness never HAS a live process to\n    revert away from (there is no engine running against `_seed_run`'s run\n    dir) -- which is exactly the point of the decision: a plain resume\n    passes the three knobs from job.yaml's own recorded values, never from\n    anything a live container might have set. So job.yaml's own\n    `max_approaches`/`job_timeout_s`/`iteration_timeout_s` are left\n    completely untouched when the resume passes none of the three flags,\n    unlike `iterations`, whose value CAN come from status.json (task\n    010/#51) -- see test_cli_resume.py's\n    `test_resume_iterations_topup_adds_to_status_json_not_job_yaml_when_higher`\n    for the contrasting case that pins `iterations` on the other side of\n    this same decision.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The #94 (d) decision, proven at the CLI-black-box level: the three<br />\nnew knobs are process-only. This harness never HAS a live process to<br />\nrevert away from (there is no engine running against <code>_seed_run</code>'s run<br />\ndir) -- which is exactly the point of the decision: a plain resume<br />\npasses the three knobs from job.yaml's own recorded values, never from<br />\nanything a live container might have set. So job.yaml's own<br />\n<code>max_approaches</code>/<code>job_timeout_s</code>/<code>iteration_timeout_s</code> are left<br />\ncompletely untouched when the resume passes none of the three flags,<br />\nunlike <code>iterations</code>, whose value CAN come from status.json (task<br />\n010/#51) -- see test_cli_resume.py's<br />\n<code>test_resume_iterations_topup_adds_to_status_json_not_job_yaml_when_higher</code><br />\nfor the contrasting case that pins <code>iterations</code> on the other side of<br />\nthis same decision.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791925216356,"stop":1791925216356,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791925216356,"stop":1791925216357,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791925297540,"stop":1791925297544,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791925297540,"stop":1791925297540,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791925297544,"stop":1791925297548,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791925297544,"stop":1791925297544,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time